{
    "_id": "the-brave",
    "name": "The Brave",
    "instructions": "1. Combine the ingredients in a wine glass and gently swirl to combine.\n2. Using an atomizer, spray 3 bursts of Angostura bitters on the drink’s surface. (Alternatively, add 3 drops of Angostura to the drink.)\n3. Take a coin-size slice of orange peel and—while carefully holding a lit match slightly above and to the side of the drink’s surface—spray its oils through the flame and atop the drink.",
